<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (To deliver customized high-quality products with state-of-the-art technology for enhancing and empowering our customers' needs. To be the global leader in efficiently solving our customers' requirements in the Defence and Aerospace industry. Johnnette Technologies has been delivering advanced aerospace systems to Indian Armed Forces, Paramilitary, and our Commercial clients. Our primary goal is to enhance our solutions continuously and ensure that they align with all the dynamic needs of the industry.  Our expertise in Unmanned Systems Technology has helped to develop cutting edge Unmanned Aerial Vehicles \(UAVs\) that are capable of carrying out tasks that are impossible otherwise by humans. With a military-qualified expert team, Johnnette has provided various solutions to the military and commercial sectors. We have delivered more than 700 drones to the Indian Defence. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
