/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 174 0 R
/E (The Johnnette JM-3 is a state-of-the-art VTOL fixed-wing loitering munition designed for medium-range anti-personnel and anti-material operations, including AI-guided engagement of moving armoured and personnel targets. With a range of 50 km and an endurance of 60 minutes, it features a high-explosive warhead filled with approximately 1000 shrapnel with a 15-meter kill radius. The JM-3 is equipped with advanced day and night engagement capabilities, utilising a low-light camera and an IR camera. Its multi-mode guidance system ensures effective operation in contested environments, while robust safety features enhance mission reliability. This platform is ECCM compliant.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
