/E (JF-3 VTOL is an advanced tactical fixed-wing UAV designed for Intelligence, Surveillance, Target Acquisition, and Reconnaissance \(ISTAR\) missions. With Vertical Take-Off and Landing capability, it enables operations from confined areas without requiring a runway. The platform offers long endurance, low acoustic signature, and high operational flexibility for battlefield, border, and maritime surveillance. Equipped with advanced MICRO-600 EO/IR sensor payloads, JF-3 VTOL ensures reliable real-time monitoring and situational awareness in diverse operational environments. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
