655 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (The Johnnette ITAKS \(Integrated Targeting and Kill System\) is an advanced solution that seamlessly integrates two specialised UAVs to deliver a decisive tactical edge in combat scenarios. The system combines the capabilities of the Johnnette JF-3, a Tactical ISR UAV, and the Johnnette JM-2, a Loitering munition, to enable swift and synchronised operations. The JF-3 is responsible for real-time reconnaissance and target acquisition, using high-resolution sensors to identify and relay target data to the control centre. This information is then utilised by the JM-2, which executes precise strike missions. Together, these UAVs form a tightly coordinated kill chain, significantly reducing response time and enhancing mission effectiveness. ITAKS is designed for salvo attacks on the enemy that completely decimate their positions.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
